{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"I’m choosing an 8-line direct-mapped word cache: one tag compare in EX, one registered hit/data sideband into MEM, fill on completed RAM reads, invalidate on completed RAM stores to the same word line. That keeps the behavior conservative while still hiding repeated-load dmem stalls."}}
