{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"Before editing, I’m accounting for a subtle store/load interaction: if a store to a cached line is completing in MEM while a younger load probes in EX, the probe must not see the stale line. The cache probe will therefore kill hits that alias an in-flight store line, and the store invalidates the entry once the external write completes."}}
