{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"agent_message","text":"Now I’m registering the probe result beside the existing EX/MEM memory metadata. The hit bit is gated by the registered cacheable decision so stale probe data cannot accidentally satisfy an uncached access."}}
