{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"agent_message","text":"Next is the sequential side: reset invalidates every cache line, completed read misses fill one line, and completed RAM stores invalidate a matching line. Cache hits don’t touch the external bus or mutate cache state."}}
