{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The bench core is a single-issue `nret: 1` setup in this worktree. The key implementation detail is that an M op in `ID/EX` must hold its decoded instruction while older stages drain, and the EX/MEM slot should become a bubble until the M result is ready so we don’t replay the previous instruction."}}
