e ALU contains\\ncombinational RV32M multiply and divide hardware in the same case tree as\\nADD, branch compare, address generation, and CoreMark's hot integer ops,\\nevery ordinary instruction pays for the longest arithmetic structure in\\nFmax even when no M-extension instru\n…[3420 of 6492 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:f0e4758e4fd3a178]…\n, \"fitness\": 62.5, \"delta_pct\": 415.68, \"vs_baseline\": 415.68, \"fmax_mhz\": 47.45, \"ipc_coremark\": 1e-06, \"cycles\": 7592564, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3028, \"ff\": 826, \"seeds\": [47.688, 47.45, 47.45], \"perturbations\": [[0, 47.688, 21], [1, 47.45, 21], [2, 47.45, 21]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 0, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -15.969, \"arrival_ns\": 26.264, \"logic_cells\": 49, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 21, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T06:17:03.980926Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 1, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-04 hyp-20261004-002-r1s1 (regression, +415.68%): Splitting all RV32M ops into a front-end-stalling multi-cycle unit regresses CoreMark because its MUL-heavy hot loops lose single-cycle throughput; keep MUL on the fast path and move only rare DIV/REM off the EX ALU cone.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
