{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"One small architectural wrinkle surfaced: RV32I still traps on halfword-aligned JAL targets when C is absent. I’m going to predict only direct JALs whose computed target is word-aligned, so the existing misalignment trap path remains exactly in charge for the odd case."}}
