{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"agent_message","text":"The trace shows a trained memo at PC `0x7f4` with target `0x4f4`, and later a different symbolic branch at the same PC retires with `pc_wdata=0x4f4` while the next retirement comes from the old predicted path. That is the arbitrary-imem target-change case, so the RTL needs a tiny validation token beyond “predicted taken” if it is to satisfy formal."}}
