ns.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Adjust IF/hazard wiring only as needed if the fetch-stage flush port is removed or tied off; keep the nret=1 top-level IO unchanged.\"\n  - file: test/test_imem_stall_flush.py\n    description: \"Cover imem stalls alone, imem stalls coincident with redirects, load-use bubbles, dmem stalls, and divider busy holds to verify no lost redirect or double retirement.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
