e final divide sign-correction/result-select work into a registered finish cycle.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add only the compact helper encoding needed to distinguish low MUL from slow high-half multiply and divider finish states.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Keep focused RV32M vectors for low MUL, high-half multiply variants, divide-by-zero, signed overflow, and remainder sign cases.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
