ear-accepted designs.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 7\n  confidence: medium\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add fwd_rs1_sel and fwd_rs2_sel fields to the ID/EX bundle so bypass choices become registered instruction metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Retarget the forwarding unit to compute next-cycle select bits from IF/ID source registers and the current ID/EX and EX/MEM producer metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Latch the precomputed forwarding selects with the decoded instruction and hold or clear them with the existing stall and flush behavior.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use the registered ID/EX forwarding selects for operand muxing instead of live comparator outputs from the same cycle.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire early forwarding inputs from the current pipeline producer stages and remove the same-cycle forward-select loop into EX.\"\n  - file: test/test_decode_forwarding.py\n    description: \"Cover ALU, MUL, JAL, DIV completion, load-use, dmem-stall, and redirect cases to prove the age-shifted forwarding selects match the old behavior.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
