ons freeze fetch/decode without double-retiring or losing pending memory state.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the new execute-busy handshake between EX and the existing hazard/stall network.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add any control bit or helper encoding needed to identify M-extension operations cleanly in execute.\"\n  - file: rtl/muldiv_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add a compact sequential RV32M unit shared by all multiply/divide/remainder variants, including divide-by-zero and signed overflow cases.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
