path for loads/stores, latch it into EX/MEM, and leave the existing ALU path for arithmetic, jumps, and single-cycle MUL.\"\n  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use the EX/MEM effective-address field for dmem_addr, byte masks, misalignment detection, load shifting, and RVFI aligned memory reporting.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Optionally keep EX/MEM forwarding limited to non-load writeback results so the new memory address rail is not accidentally treated as load data.\"\n  - file: test/test_agu_memory.py\n    description: \"Add focused cocotb coverage for dependent store data, byte and halfword accesses, misaligned traps, and load/store addresses after forwarded ALU producers.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
