with per-variant multiply rails plus a compact multiply-select encoding.\"\n  - file: rtl/alu.sv\n    description: \"Expose separate MUL, MULH, MULHU, and MULHSU product outputs for the core datapath while preserving the legacy op-selected ALU output for standalone tests.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Latch the separate multiply rails directly into EX/MEM and generate the multiply-select metadata without adding execute bubbles.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Update EX/MEM forwarding selection so WB_SEL_MUL chooses among registered multiply rails using the carried multiply-select code.\"\n  - file: rtl/wb_stage.sv\n    description: \"Move final multiply variant selection into writeback on registered MEM/WB rails.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Retain or extend multiply signedness edge vectors to guard the separated product rails and the legacy ALU output.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
