idence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove single-cycle DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU operators from the combinational ALU and leave only RV32I plus single-cycle multiply results on the fast path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate/control an iterative divider for DIV/REM ops, hold the EX/MEM register while it runs, and mux its comple\n…[173856 of 176928 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b2174fea57109200]…\nseline\": 965.43, \"fmax_mhz\": 51.673, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4001512, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3584, \"ff\": 987, \"seeds\": [50.241, 51.673, 51.673], \"perturbations\": [[0, 50.241, 18], [1, 51.673, 19], [2, 51.673, 19]], \"lutram\": 16, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -14.904, \"arrival_ns\": 25.199, \"logic_cells\": 37, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 18, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T09:30:30.481188Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 13, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-04 hyp-20261004-003-r13s2 (regression, -8.77%): Hot-loop replay regressed because IF still paid per-fetch loop range/index/fill-mask control and an instruction replay mux, while `imem_ready_eff` stall plumbing and `loop_pred_wrap` EX repair sidebands taxed every CoreMark fetch more than skipped loop-body imem stalls saved.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
